        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Indigenous theatre practitioners are invited into constellations of care through this gathering. The discussion will include Knowledge and Teachings from the Industry Series that can guide us in lifting one another up as artistic-relations. <em>Co-hosted with wîcêhtowin Theatre Program, University of Saskatchewan </em><strong>This session is closed and will require registration. <em>Co-hosted with wîcêhtowin Theatre Program, University of Saskatchewan </em><strong>This session is closed and will require registration </strong></strong></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Co-hosted with wîcêhtowin Theatre Program, University of Saskatchewan </p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
