        "@value": "Still. Reflect. Respond."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Respected choreographers and dance artists contemplate where the dance community is in collective practice— where we’ve come from and what we carry with us as we navigate current cultural, social, and political realities. Facilitators: Jessica McMannVictoria HuntCharles KoronehoJack GrayMichelle Olsonhosted by Mique’l Dangeli "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
