        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In the Presence of Ancestor: The “Hovering Community”"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Are we transformed virtual beings, new sky citizens of the “Hovering Community” territory of distance and proximity desire? Is this a new space to meet our ancestors, to discover spaces of ancient and future presences? Charles Koroneho respectfully acknowledges Altofest 202X for the support given in the preparation of this workshop and the offer of exchange from The Talking Stick Festival. </p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Guest: Charles Koroneho hosted by Jeanette Kotowich </p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
    ],
