        "@value": "Indigenous Music Reconnection"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Indigenous Music community members are invited to reconnect at this virtual roundtable. Honouring the work of musicians that have played a path for us, we will discuss ways to create in these newly uncertain times and what our community needs for growth—distanced and in-person. <strong>This session is closed and will require registration. </strong></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Artists:<br />Denise Bolduc<br />Orene Askew<br />Curtis Clearsky<br />Jade Harper</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
