        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>An invitation to the international Indigenous dance community to circle together and offer our thoughts and dreams to our ancestors during these unprecedented times. <strong>This session is closed and will require registration. </strong></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Special guests Louise Potiki Bryant and Olivia Davies hosted by Starr Muranko </p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
