        "@value": "Talking Circle: Mentorship as Legacy Building"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Guests: Ange Loft, Spy Dénommé-Welch, Christine Friday, Ronnie Dean Harris, Starrwind Muranko, hosted by Jennifer Dawn Bishop</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>This talking circle will focus on sharing new and anti-colonial strategies around mentorship and leadership, with an interdisciplinary focus. This circle is open to Indigenous artists, mentors, teachers, and learners from all disciplines and practices.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Pre-register via Eventbrite at <a href='https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/talking-circle-mentorship-as-legacy-building-tickets-151338709153' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener'>Talking Circle: Mentorship as Legacy Building</a></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
