      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "</p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Artists: Herbie Barnes, Keith Barker, Edzi&#8217;u, Ronnie Dean Harris, Zach Running Coyote, Lisa Naason, Reneltta Arluk, Margaret Grenier, Brian Solomon, Chris Reed, Jenn Cole, Rob Thomson, Lori Marchand</p><p> <!-- /wp:paragraph --></p></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>A video series with thirteen Indigenous artists reflecting on the question &#8211; what seeds are you planting for the future? These artists will speak to a collective commitment to the future we all need.</p><p> <!-- /wp:paragraph --></p></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Note: The VIMEO link will be displayed below at the time of the event.</p><p> <!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
