        "@value": "Tara Williamson has been described as a poet and provocateur - the spark that ignites the flame. A"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/events/tara-williamson-the-good-liars/event_13771_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/events/tara-williamson-the-good-liars/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/events/tara-williamson-the-good-liars/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/events/tara-williamson-the-good-liars/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tara Williamson &amp; The Good Liars"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Tara Williamson has been described as a poet and provocateur &#8211; the spark that ignites the flame. A Victoria-based First Nations singer/songwriter from Manitoba, her music is an unflinching document of self: the truth that hurts before it heals. Her sophisticated lyrics and soulful voice are a rising force on the Indigenous and Canadian music scene.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>For more info check out <a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0Mw5n1BGGHk' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener'>Tara Williamson &amp; The Good Liars &#8211; Talking Stick Festival 2021 on Youtube</a> and <a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0Mw5n1BGGHk  https://www.facebook.com/talkingstickfest' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener'>The Talking Stick Festival on Facebook</a></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2021-6-18T19:00-8::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2021-6-18T20:00-8::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OnlineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
