      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Vancouver International Film Festival and Museum of Vancouver have partnered to commemorate Indigenous History Month with the Who We Are film series. This series was selected by Indigenous Curators: Rylan Friday, Jasmine Wilson and Sharon Fortney. Their curatorial goal is to celebrate Indigenous voices in cinema, to showcase strong engaging stories from First Nations, Métis, Inuit and Maori filmmakers while showing the beauty, complexities and vibrancies of Indigeneity around the globe."
      }
