    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p><meta charset='utf-8'>Mawessine: United FOR and THROUGH Indigenous Art &#8211; Les Productions Ondinnok&#8217;s 35th Anniversary Gala.</p><p>Celebrating 35 years of artistic creation and resistance! To mark this milestone and revive the spirit of ancient alliances, Mawessine (“united” in Wolastqey), brings together Ondinnok’s extended artistic family to revisit and celebrate its history.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
