    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nch&#039;u7mut cheshá7 temíxw - Giving back to mother earth"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph {'align':'center'} --></p><p class='has-text-align-center'>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&#8220;Always giving graceful thanks to our life giver, provider and inspiration &#8211;&nbsp;<em>Nch&#8217;u7mut cheshá7 temíxw / Giving Back to&nbsp; Mother Earth</em>&#8221; &#8211; Dennis Joseph&nbsp;</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p><em>Nch&#8217;u7mut cheshá7 temíxw / Giving Back to Mother Earth</em>&nbsp;is a land based and ephemeral art exhibition that investigates how our relation to the land has shifted or deepened as a result of the disruption caused by the pandemic.&nbsp;<em>Nch&#8217;u7mut cheshá7 temíxw / Giving Back to Mother Earth&nbsp;</em>questions how this altered connection can inform our uncertain futures.&nbsp;</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>This curated exhibition invites a practicing of non-permanence and allows a moment to reflect on the often unequal relationship of give-and-take between peoples and land.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>For more event info click here: <a href='https://fullcircle.ca/nchu7mut-chesha7-temixw-giving-back-to-mother-earth/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener'>https://fullcircle.ca/nchu7mut-chesha7-temixw-giving-back-to-mother-earth/</a></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Curated by Amina Creighton-Kelly&nbsp;</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OnlineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g1854700",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/OnlineEventAttendanceMode"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/temporary/c8bebe3f-11a0-4351-975e-39bc66dbf965",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://fullcircle.ca/events/nchu7mut-chesha7-temixw-giving-back-to-mother-earth/"
