        "@value": "Plant Walk with Cease Wyss"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Join T’uy’t’tanat Cease Wyss, ethnobotanist, media artist, educator and activist of Skwxwu7mesh/Stó:lō/Hawaiian/Swiss ancestry. On a sunny spring day, she led festival Artistic Managing Director, Margo Kane, on a journey of botanical discovery through Stanley Park. Cease shares her extensive plant and forest knowledge, talks about medicines, traditional teachings and the interconnectedness of nature and the forest.&nbsp;</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Note: The show will be broadcasted below at the time of the event.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
