        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Please join our afternoon conversation to consider exploring how Indigenous artist residencies can co-create new models of colonial disruption and cultural transformation &#8211; both inside and outside of mainstream arts organizations.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>This event is FREE.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Register for this event here: <a href='https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/residencies-as-reimaginings-a-roundtable-conversation-tickets-194773251037' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener'>https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/residencies-as-reimaginings-a-roundtable-conversation-tickets-194773251037</a></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
