        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Talking Stick Gala Comes Full Circle!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>This is an evening for reflection and honouring, certainly – and to thank those who have joined us on our year-long program of presenting performances during the four seasons of fire – as well as to rejoice, celebrate and look forward together.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Enjoy a community feast, moccasin contest, and special performances. This event is FREE.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Register for this event here: <a href='https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/talking-stick-gala-comes-full-circle-tickets-196122988137' data-type='URL' data-id='https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/talking-stick-gala-comes-full-circle-tickets-196122988137'>https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/talking-stick-gala-comes-full-circle-tickets-196122988137</a></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p> "
      }
