    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DTES Powwow Honouring the Children"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>This year, the DTES Powwow honours all of the Children we lost at residential schools and their families and all of our people living with the consequences of that legacy. This event offers some unique, handmade Indigenous arts and crafts available for sale to the public. Admission is free with proceeds going to the families of the victims of the residential schools massacre.</p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
