        "@value": "Blending Teas with Westcoast Wild Plants Workshop"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Blending teas with Westcoast wild plants. Learn how to identify a variety of plants that grow in the Pacific Northwest Coast and how to uniquely blend different medicinal herbs together.</p><p>Workshop led by an instructor with close to 30 years of experience blending teas with commonly found herbal medicines. Limited capacity: 30. Free event but my RSVP to <a href='mailto:info@vnidansi.com'>info@vnidansi.com</a>.</p> "
      }
    ],
