    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival</span></p><p>This evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms.</p><p><strong>Tickets are $10 at the door</strong>. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show</p><p>Club PuSh Arists:</p><ul><li><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>Alexis Lynn</span></li><li><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>DJ O Show</span></li><li><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>DJ Paisely Eva</span></li><li><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>Haley Wallis</span></li><li><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>Quinn Pickering</span></li></ul><p><span data-sheets-value='{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Presented by Talking Stick and PuSh Festival\n\nThis evening of genre-blending madness mashes the music of Indigenous ancestors with the breaks, cuts, and booming bass of contemporary dance grooves. It’s an excitingly eclectic mix of styles, honouring traditional Indigenous idioms while presenting them in a thoroughly modern context. Enjoy a diverse lineup of artists in a mellow environment, with visuals to complement the propulsive rhythms. \n\nTickets are $10 at the door. Free for PuSh Pass holders | 50% off if you have purchased a single ticket for another show\n\nClub PuSh Arists:\nAlexis Lynn\nDJ O Show\nDJ Paisely Eva\nHaley Wallis\nQuinn Pickering\n\nCheck out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets&quot;}' data-sheets-userformat='{&quot;2&quot;:11139,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:3355443},&quot;16&quot;:10}' data-sheets-textstyleruns='{&quot;1&quot;:0}{&quot;1&quot;:446,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;5&quot;:1}}{&quot;1&quot;:474}'>Check out more details here: https://pushfestival.ca/shows/club-push-2023/#tickets</span></p> "
