    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us at “Summer Sisters Sing,” a women’s music circle celebrating the unity of music and sisterhood. Enjoy traditional Indigenous rhythms hosted by Pura Fé and share food, stories, and songs in a warm, welcoming environment. It’s a unique event honoring traditions, embracing diversity, and harnessing the power of music to bring us closer.All women including transgender, non-binary, two-spirit, and any other women identifying members of the LGBTQ+ community are welcome.Event by Invite Only, for more details click here."
