      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "West Coast Sounds: Pura Fé & Friends"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us for a night of music and fun at West Coast Sounds, co-presented by Coastal Jazz. Revel in Indigenous talent with multi-award winning composer and performer Sandy Scofield, Christielee Charles’ Musqueam language Hip Hop, Murray Porter’s soulful keyboard, Pura Fé and family’s melodic tunes, and Wayne Lavallee “Rock n’ Roll Indian Cowboy” energy. The night peaks with the vibrant Beaver Thomas Band featuring Shakti Hayes. Cheri Maracle  will host this lively celebration of music, community, and culture.Fore event details, click here. To buy tickets, click here."
