        "@value": "We warmly invite you to the Talking Stick Festival’s Summer Reverb Gala Co-Presented with SFU Woodward’s Cultural Program – an evening of vibrant entertainment, thoughtful reflection, and rekindling connections.The gala will kick off with soulful jazz on the grand piano followed by the Melawmen Collective taking centre stage and showcasing their unique blend of contemporary Indigenous Fusion that beautifully marries genres like hip-hop, rock, folk, and thick harmonies. The night will be enriched with an array of other performances, this gala promises to be an unforgettable celebration of Indigenous art and culture. We can’t wait to celebrate with you.For event details, click here. To buy tickets, click here."
