    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Let’s Powwow! Come celebrate Indigenous culture and arts at our ever popular Powwow and Artisan Fair. The Celebration of Powwow Culture during our Talking Stick Festival gathers hundreds of people from across all nations and all ages every year. Bring your friends and family and enjoy a brilliant display of traditional and contemporary Indigenous dance and art. Treat yourself to [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
