      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The members of Virago Nation invite you to take a journey into the world of Indigenous sexuality through unapologetic and empowered burlesque performances. Through humour, seduction, pop culture and politics they will show that Aboriginal women will not be confined to the colonial virgin-whore dichotomy but will design a new dynamic and multi-faceted sexual identity rooted in their own desires. Emceed by [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
