        "@value": "Kw’iyilshswit Cabaret"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Kw’iyilshswit (kwee-yay-l-sh-swait) translates to ‘they’re dancing’! – the perfect way to close the festival! Join festival favorite Beaver T (Cree) for an eclectic evening of entertainment featuring the groovy tunes and antics of the brightest Indigenous talent from across disciplines. Kick back, relax (or put yer dancin’ shoes on!), mingle with artists and share your memories of the last 2 weeks. Suitable for [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
