        "@value": "The Seventh Fire"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Seventh Fire Created by Lisa C. Ravensbergen. Project facilitated by Lisa C. Ravensbergen, Laura McLean, and Christine Quintana. Produced by Delinquent Theatre. The Seventh Fire is filmic in nature and mythic in proportion, sourcing traditional, oral Anishinaabe stories and societal roles as a way to explore ceremony in the everyday. Set in the present, past, and future, it tells the story [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
