    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Mob Bounce: Hip Hop and a Sacred Space “Hip-Hop + Sacred Space” is an interactive workshop that provides participants the opportunity to learn Mob Bounce\\'s approach to combining cultural ways of knowing the contemporary methods of musical and artistic expression. Through this process, Mob Bounce teaches concepts and techniques in understanding and developing Sacred Space with lyric writing as a [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
