      {
        "@value": "Dangerous Curves &#8211; The Burlesque Guide to Loving Your Body"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;What to expect: Dangerous curves is a class for beginner showgirls and showboys to learn how to use every inch of their body to its full potential. Rooted in voluptuous movement, this class will focus on smooth body rolls, sexy hip sways, bumps, grinds and embracing the jiggle. The class includes a dance-based warm-up and beginner level choreography set to [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
