        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Gather with us at the Scháyilhen Pop-Up Musical Bistro – our mid-festival social. This is the time to fill your plate, (and your glasses) and catch a live band accompanied by eclectic pop-up programming showcasing poets musicians and visiting artists. Includes catered meal. Cash Bar.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
