    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;First Nations Arts &amp; Culture Takes Flight With The Talking Stick Festival at YVR In partnership with YVR, the Talking Stick Festival is proud to announce a special afternoon performance at YVR airport taking place on Saturday, February 17th, from 12pm - 2pm. Located on the International Departures level in front of Bill Reid\\'s Spirit of Haida Gwaii: The Jade [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
