        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Kw’eykw`áystway (pronounced kwāy kwai stwhy) means “speaking with one another”. The Industry Series is a five (5) day forum which invites arts presenters, artists, scholars, funders and audience members together to further the development and strength of Indigenous arts. Over five days this series builds upon previous Industry Series Events to fortify existing and create new networks for the support [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
