        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Some of the best shorts from across Canada and Turtle Island are screened in the intimate Vancity Culture Lab. Grab a popcorn, get comfy and treat yourself to the cinematic works by some of Indigenous Canada’s most inspiring indigenous film artists.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
